    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Former Courtier",
      "category": "interaction",
      "text": "An exiled revolutionary remembers well their former realm. In their home realm, be it a manor, castle, or capital city, the exiled revolutionary gains a +4 circumstance bonus to Perception checks and Will saves, and to Deception, Diplomacy, Intimidation, and Stealth checks, and is a 12th-level challenge in the arena of noble politics.",
