    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "It's... You!",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "emotion",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "When the exiled revolutionary sees or hears someone who was part of their downfall in person, they break cover and attack their betrayer immediately, even if their actions would doom them and their allies. The revolutionary must succeed at a DC 35 Will save save or be Fascinated by their betrayer and unable to cease targeting them exclusively until the betrayer is defeated.\n\nAn ally can convince the revolutionary to forgo their vengeance with a DC 30 Diplomacy check to make a request dc=30. This lasts for 1 minute, but talking the revolutionary down after that time requires more thorough engagement."
    },
